# Nginx 部署配置指南

## 🎯 部署架构

```
         ┌─────────────┐
         │   用户请求   │
         └──────┬──────┘
                │
         ┌──────▼──────┐
         │    Nginx    │
         │   :80/:443  │
         └──────┬──────┘
                │
    ┌───────────┴───────────┐
    │                       │
┌───▼────┐          ┌──────▼──────┐
│ 静态文件│          │   Express   │
│ /var/www│          │   :3001     │
│         │          │   API       │
│ Gzip ✅ │          │   Gzip ✅   │
└─────────┘          └─────────────┘
```

---

## 📝 完整 Nginx 配置

### 配置文件: `/etc/nginx/sites-available/damoxing`

```nginx
# ============================================
# Upstream - Express API 服务器
# ============================================
upstream api_backend {
    server 127.0.0.1:3001;
    keepalive 64;
}

# ============================================
# HTTP -> HTTPS 重定向 (可选，生产环境推荐)
# ============================================
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name yourdomain.com www.yourdomain.com;
    
    # Let's Encrypt 验证路径
    location /.well-known/acme-challenge/ {
        root /var/www/certbot;
    }
    
    # 其他请求重定向到 HTTPS
    location / {
        return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;
    }
}

# ============================================
# HTTPS 主配置
# ============================================
server {
    # 监听端口
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    listen [::]:443 ssl http2;
    
    # 域名
    server_name yourdomain.com www.yourdomain.com;
    
    # SSL 证书配置 (使用 Let's Encrypt)
    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/privkey.pem;
    
    # SSL 优化配置
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
    ssl_ciphers HIGH:!aNULL:!MD5;
    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers on;
    ssl_session_cache shared:SSL:10m;
    ssl_session_timeout 10m;
    
    # ============================================
    # Gzip 压缩配置 (关键!)
    # ============================================
    gzip on;
    gzip_vary on;
    gzip_proxied any;
    gzip_comp_level 6;
    gzip_min_length 1024;
    gzip_types
        text/plain
        text/css
        text/xml
        text/javascript
        application/javascript
        application/x-javascript
        application/json
        application/xml
        application/xml+rss
        application/xhtml+xml
        application/x-font-ttf
        application/x-font-opentype
        application/vnd.ms-fontobject
        image/svg+xml
        image/x-icon;
    
    # ============================================
    # Brotli 压缩 (可选，更优)
    # ============================================
    # 需要安装 ngx_brotli 模块
    # brotli on;
    # brotli_comp_level 6;
    # brotli_types text/plain text/css application/javascript application/json image/svg+xml;
    
    # ============================================
    # 日志配置
    # ============================================
    access_log /var/log/nginx/damoxing_access.log;
    error_log /var/log/nginx/damoxing_error.log warn;
    
    # ============================================
    # 安全头
    # ============================================
    add_header X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN" always;
    add_header X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff" always;
    add_header X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block" always;
    add_header Referrer-Policy "no-referrer-when-downgrade" always;
    
    # ============================================
    # 静态文件托管 (前端)
    # ============================================
    location / {
        root /var/www/damoxing/client/dist;
        index index.html;
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
        
        # 静态资源缓存策略
        # HTML 文件不缓存（或短期缓存）
        location ~* \.html$ {
            expires -1;
            add_header Cache-Control "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate";
        }
        
        # JS/CSS 文件长期缓存（因为有 hash）
        location ~* \.(js|css)$ {
            expires 1y;
            add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
        }
        
        # 字体文件
        location ~* \.(woff|woff2|ttf|eot|otf)$ {
            expires 1y;
            add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
        }
        
        # 图片文件
        location ~* \.(jpg|jpeg|png|gif|ico|svg|webp)$ {
            expires 6M;
            add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
        }
    }
    
    # ============================================
    # API 反向代理
    # ============================================
    location /api {
        # 代理到 Express
        proxy_pass http://api_backend;
        
        # 代理头设置
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection 'upgrade';
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        
        # 超时设置
        proxy_connect_timeout 60s;
        proxy_send_timeout 60s;
        proxy_read_timeout 60s;
        
        # 缓存绕过
        proxy_cache_bypass $http_upgrade;
    }
    
    # ============================================
    # 健康检查 (不缓存)
    # ============================================
    location /health {
        proxy_pass http://api_backend;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        access_log off;
    }
    
    # ============================================
    # favicon.ico (避免404)
    # ============================================
    location = /favicon.ico {
        log_not_found off;
        access_log off;
    }
    
    # ============================================
    # robots.txt
    # ============================================
    location = /robots.txt {
        log_not_found off;
        access_log off;
    }
}
```

---

## 🚀 部署步骤

### 1. 构建前端

```bash
cd /path/to/damoxing/client
npm install
npm run build

# 生成 dist/ 目录
```

### 2. 上传文件到服务器

```bash
# 上传前端
scp -r dist/ user@server:/var/www/damoxing/client/

# 上传后端
scp -r server/ user@server:/var/www/damoxing/
```

### 3. 服务器上安装依赖

```bash
# 后端依赖
cd /var/www/damoxing/server
npm install --production

# 数据库迁移
npm run db:migrate

# 环境变量
cp .env.example .env
nano .env  # 编辑配置
```

### 4. 配置 Nginx

```bash
# 复制配置文件
sudo nano /etc/nginx/sites-available/damoxing

# 粘贴上面的配置（修改域名和路径）

# 创建软链接
sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/damoxing /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/

# 测试配置
sudo nginx -t

# 重启 Nginx
sudo systemctl restart nginx
```

### 5. 配置 PM2 (后端进程管理)

```bash
# 安装 PM2
npm install -g pm2

# 启动应用
cd /var/www/damoxing/server
pm2 start index.js --name damoxing-api

# 保存配置
pm2 save

# 开机自启
pm2 startup
```

### 6. 配置 SSL (Let's Encrypt)

```bash
# 安装 certbot
sudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx

# 获取证书
sudo certbot --nginx -d yourdomain.com -d www.yourdomain.com

# 自动续期
sudo certbot renew --dry-run
```

---

## 📊 验证部署

### 1. 检查前端

```bash
# 访问首页
curl -I https://yourdomain.com

# 应该看到:
# HTTP/2 200
# Content-Encoding: gzip  ✅
```

### 2. 检查静态文件

```bash
# 测试 vendor.js
curl -H "Accept-Encoding: gzip" \
     -I https://yourdomain.com/assets/js/vendor-xxx.js

# 应该看到:
# Content-Encoding: gzip  ✅
# Content-Length: ~2500000  (gzip后大小)
# Cache-Control: public, immutable, max-age=31536000
```

### 3. 检查 API

```bash
# 测试 API
curl -H "Accept-Encoding: gzip" \
     https://yourdomain.com/api/system/menu

# 应该返回 JSON
```

### 4. 检查健康状态

```bash
curl https://yourdomain.com/health/detailed
```

