## 📁 服务器目录结构

```
/var/www/damoxing/
├── client/
│   └── dist/              # 前端构建产物
│       ├── index.html
│       └── assets/
│           ├── js/
│           │   ├── vendor-xxx.js  8.9M → 2.4M (gzip)
│           │   ├── amis-xxx.js    1.2M → 300K (gzip)
│           │   └── index-xxx.js   7.2K → 3K (gzip)
│           └── css/
└── server/                # 后端代码
    ├── index.js
    ├── routes/
    ├── db/
    ├── database.sqlite
    ├── logs/
    └── .env
```

---

## 🔧 常用维护命令

### Nginx

```bash
# 重启
sudo systemctl restart nginx

# 重新加载配置
sudo nginx -s reload

# 测试配置
sudo nginx -t

# 查看日志
sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/damoxing_error.log
```

### PM2

```bash
# 查看状态
pm2 status

# 重启应用
pm2 restart damoxing-api

# 查看日志
pm2 logs damoxing-api

# 监控
pm2 monit
```

### 数据库备份

```bash
# 使用我们的备份脚本
cd /var/www/damoxing/server
./scripts/backup-db.sh

# 定时任务
crontab -e
# 添加: 0 3 * * * cd /var/www/damoxing/server && ./scripts/backup-db.sh
```

---

## ⚡ 性能监控

### 1. Nginx 访问日志分析

```bash
# 查看访问量
sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/damoxing_access.log

# 统计请求数
cat /var/log/nginx/damoxing_access.log | wc -l
```

### 2. 压缩率验证

```bash
# 对比压缩前后大小
ls -lh /var/www/damoxing/client/dist/assets/js/vendor-*.js
# vs
curl -H "Accept-Encoding: gzip" \
     -I https://yourdomain.com/assets/js/vendor-xxx.js \
     | grep Content-Length
```

---

